---
import { socialLinks, whatsappUrl } from '../../data/landing';
---

<footer class="relative px-4 pt-16 pb-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" data-reveal>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="section-divider mb-16"></div></div>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="grid gap-12 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr_1fr]">
            <div class="space-y-5">
                <a href="#home" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"
                        style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b52ff 0%, #00d4ff 100%); box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(37,99,235,0.2);">
                        <span class="text-sm font-black text-white">A</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-base font-bold tracking-[0.14em] text-white">AVANCIA</p>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium tracking-wide">Software · Automatización · Tecnología</p>
                    </div>
                </a>
                <p class="max-w-sm text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">
                    Tecnología que hace avanzar tu negocio. Diseñamos soluciones digitales enfocadas en mejorar procesos, reducir tareas manuales y crear nuevas capacidades.
                </p>

                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    {[
                        { label: 'WhatsApp', href: whatsappUrl, icon: 'fa-brands fa-whatsapp' },
                        ...socialLinks.map(s => ({
                            label: s.label,
                            href: s.href,
                            icon: s.label === 'Instagram' ? 'fa-brands fa-instagram' : s.label === 'Facebook' ? 'fa-brands fa-facebook' : 'fa-brands fa-tiktok'
                        }))
                    ].map((social) => (
                        <a href={social.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label={social.label}
                            class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-slate-400 transition-all duration-300 hover:text-cyan-300 hover:scale-110"
                            style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);">
                            <i class={`${social.icon} text-sm`}></i>
                        </a>
                    ))}
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-4">
                <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-slate-500">Capacidades</p>
                <ul class="space-y-2.5">
                    {['Software a medida', 'Automatización', 'Sistemas empresariales', 'IA aplicada'].map((item) => (
                        <li><a href="#servicios" class="footer-link text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors hover:text-white">{item}</a></li>
                    ))}
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-4">
                <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-slate-500">Contacto</p>
                <ul class="space-y-2.5">
                    <li>
                        <a href={whatsappUrl} class="footer-link inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors hover:text-white">
                            <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp text-cyan-400/70 text-sm"></i>
                            WhatsApp directo
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    {socialLinks.map((social) => (
                        <li>
                            <a href={social.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                                class="footer-link text-sm text-slate-400 transition-colors hover:text-white">
                                {social.label}
                            </a>
                        </li>
                    ))}
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-16 flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-white/5 pt-8 sm:flex-row">
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">© {new Date().getFullYear()} AVANCIA · Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">Hecho en México</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>

<style>
    .footer-link { position: relative; }
    .footer-link::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        bottom: -1px;
        left: 0;
        width: 0;
        height: 1px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2563eb, #22d3ee);
        transition: width 260ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
    .footer-link:hover::after { width: 100%; }
</style>